5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I need to know how much time we lose just moving desks and plugging in.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to see the actual monthly cost of this floor before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am worried about who gets the window seats and who gets the wall.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I need to know if the noise level will be bearable for eight hours.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to understand how sitting next to someone changes our daily conversations.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, does the cost include the time we spend packing and unpacking?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the billing is for space, not time, but the quote for moving is separate.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, the window side is usually quieter, but I am not sure about the printer row.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I have noticed the hum from the corridor side is quite loud.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Rin, if we move often, we might not settle in at all.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the morning routine on the pilot floor to see the time cost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look at the basis of the department's floor billing to understand the expense.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will check the drawn plan against the staff survey to see the complaints.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will get the sound meter readings across the room to verify the noise.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will look at what this year's two joiners reported about overhearing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Also, I will check the arrival times in the badge records to see the spread.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,And I will check the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will also check the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will also check the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I will also check the two project strands within earshot last spring.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
