33,2,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The pilot floor took up to nine minutes to set up. That is huge.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The floor billing is for area, not heads. Empty desks still cost us money.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The survey says daylight is the biggest complaint. The plan gives only four windows.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The printer row is nine decibels louder. My chair needs days to adjust.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The new joiners learned the work by overhearing. Proximity is key.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if we move desks, we pay the facilities quote again?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, yes, 6,200 yen per desk for every change. It adds up fast.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if the window side is quieter, we should prioritize those seats.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I agree, but the chair adjustment is a personal struggle.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Rin, nine minutes is too long. We need a system that minimizes setup.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I hate the idea of spending my morning just plugging in screens.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The cost of changing the layout is high. We need a stable plan.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If we rotate, the window seats change hands. That might be fairer.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,Rotating means I have to re-adjust my chair every time. That is painful.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"If we sit with the same people, we talk more. That is good for the team.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am leaning towards a system where we don't move often.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The financial penalty for shuffling is too high.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,But we must ensure the window seats are distributed fairly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,I need a spot that is quiet and where my chair stays set.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I want to be near people I can learn from.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
