60,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A is too chaotic. Option B is too much moving. Option C is stable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option C is the only one that avoids repeated facility charges.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Option C allows us to assign the window seats permanently.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option C lets me keep my chair settings. I prefer it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option C keeps us in the same groups. I like that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, does Option C mean we never move again?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, yes, unless the team size changes significantly.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if you get a window seat, will you be happy?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, if it is quiet, yes. I will check the meter again.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Rin, I think stability is better for our conversations.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,"I am worried about the initial setup time, but I accept it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,The long-term savings on facility quotes are significant.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,We can rotate the window seats annually to keep it fair.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,I am comfortable with a fixed desk if it is the quiet one.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I am happy to sit with the same people. It builds trust.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,I vote for C.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I vote for C.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
